      "content": "Wait really?? that sounds super scary. i really don't want to go to the ER, it's so expensive and the wait times are terrible. is there really no way to just treat this at home? maybe a super strong dose of aspirin or something to thin my blood? i just want to avoid the hospital if possible.",
